title: An Election Across the Galaxy
subtitle: A world goes to the polls, and the Senate is watching.
tags: event
view-if: wv_ready and not finale and not game_ending
priority: 2
new-page: true
face-image: img/ev_senate.svg
on-arrival: {! SW.worldElectionOpen(Q); Q.we_rally = 0; !}

= [+ wv_heading +]

[+ wv_world +] holds [+ wv_name +]: [+ wv_ours +] against [+ wv_theirs +]. *At stake:* [+ wv_stakes +]

The polls give [+ wv_ours +] about **[+ wv_poll +]%**. Our support in the [+ wv_region_name +] and the Caucus's momentum shape the poll. Senators answer to their home worlds, so the result will move delegations in the Senate too. A win lifts our momentum; a loss costs it, more so if we campaigned. [? if wv_has_adv : [+ wv_adv_name +] is one of our advisors, and this is home ground. ?]

- @hard: Campaign hard on [+ wv_world +].
- @advisor: Send [? if wv_has_adv : [+ wv_adv_name +] ?][? if not wv_has_adv : one of our advisors ?]to campaign.
- @money: Let the guilds fund our side.
- @out: Stay out of it.

@hard
subtitle: −2 political capital. A big boost, but rallies can be attacked.
choose-if: capital >= 2
unavailable-subtitle: Needs 2 political capital.
on-arrival: {! SW.worldCampaign(Q, 'hard'); Q.we_rally = SW.rallyRisk(Q, Q.wv_region, 0.05); if (!Q.we_rally) SW.worldResolve(Q); !}
go-to: result if not we_rally; disrupted if we_rally

@advisor
choose-if: advisor_action_timer <= 0 and n_advisors >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: [? if n_advisors < 1 : We have no advisors to send. ?][? if n_advisors >= 1 : The advisors' action is not ready yet. ?]
subtitle: Uses the advisors' action. [? if wv_has_adv : Their own world: a strong boost. ?][? if not wv_has_adv : A modest boost. ?]
on-arrival: {! SW.worldCampaign(Q, 'advisor'); SW.worldResolve(Q); !}
go-to: result

@money
view-if: guild_patience >= 40
subtitle: A boost. Corruption grows, and the Rimward wing objects.
on-arrival: {! SW.worldCampaign(Q, 'money'); SW.worldResolve(Q); !}
go-to: result

@out
subtitle: The poll decides. A loss costs us less.
on-arrival: {! SW.worldResolve(Q); !}
go-to: result

@disrupted

The Caucus's rally in the [+ cm_region_name +] is stormed by [+ cm_disruptor +]. Speakers are shouted down, delegates are threatened, and the HoloNet cameras are rolling. How will the Caucus protect its people?

*Their strength is about [+ cm_threat +]. The Judicial Forces bring about [+ jf_txt +]; local security, where we are popular, about [+ cm_local +][? if senate_guard_reformed : ; the reformed Senate Guard, 5?]. Each time the Caucus leans on armed force, the Pacifists like it less.*

- @protect_judicials: Call in the Judicial Forces.
- @protect_guard: Ask the Senate Guard to protect us.
- @protect_local: Rely on local security.
- @protect_cancel: Cancel the rally.

@protect_judicials
subtitle: The Pacifists dislike the Caucus relying on armed force.
on-arrival: {! if (!SW.rallyProtect(Q, 'judicials')) Q.wv_boost -= 0.15; SW.worldResolve(Q); !}
go-to: result

@protect_guard
view-if: senate_guard_reformed
subtitle: The reformed Senate Guard answers to the Senate, and is formidable.
on-arrival: {! if (!SW.rallyProtect(Q, 'guard')) Q.wv_boost -= 0.15; SW.worldResolve(Q); !}
go-to: result

@protect_local
on-arrival: {! if (!SW.rallyProtect(Q, 'local')) Q.wv_boost -= 0.15; SW.worldResolve(Q); !}
go-to: result

@protect_cancel
subtitle: No one is hurt. The campaign loses its edge.
on-arrival: {! SW.rallyProtect(Q, 'cancel'); Q.wv_boost -= 0.1; SW.worldResolve(Q); !}
go-to: result


@result

[? if we_rally and cm_protect_won : The rally was attacked, but the Caucus's protection held, and the campaign went ahead. ?][? if we_rally and not cm_protect_won : The attack on our rally broke up the campaign's best day. ?][? if cm_force_note : The Pacifists warn that the Caucus is starting to look like a party with a private army. ?]

[? if wv_won : **[+ wv_ours +] win, with [+ wv_ours_pct +]% of the vote.** ?][? if not wv_won : **[+ wv_theirs +] win; [+ wv_ours +] take [+ wv_ours_pct +]%.** ?] [? if wv_won : The HoloNet reads it as a verdict on the Caucus, and the [+ wv_region_name +]'s delegations take note. ?][? if not wv_won : The Caucus's opponents crow, and delegations in the [+ wv_region_name +] drift away from us. ?] [? if wv_lost_adv : [+ wv_lost_adv +] must return home to rebuild, and steps back from the Caucus's inner circle for a year. ?]
